1
00:00:00,967 --> 00:00:04,104
First, select the “CTA Canvas”

2
00:00:04,104 --> 00:00:07,073
Create “Hotspot Area” and set it as “Animation”

3
00:00:07,073 --> 00:00:11,644
You can adjust the “Anchor Position” of your animation

4
00:00:11,644 --> 00:00:15,682
Then, activate your hotspot position of where the animation will be displayed

5
00:00:15,682 --> 00:00:20,587
Select your animated images from your “Favorite Assets”

6
00:00:20,587 --> 00:00:23,656
You can adjust the setting of each animated image

7
00:00:23,656 --> 00:00:32,098
Such as the display time, and adding shadow or stroke effects

8
00:00:34,134 --> 00:00:40,540
In preview, the animation will play automatically
